OL,3,GNEWSAEx-chief constable admits
OL,4,Amisconduct over affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former chief constable of Hampshire
OL,7,Fand Isle of Wight Constabulary has
OL,8,Fadmitted misconduct over an
OL,9,Fextra-marital affair while he was in
OL,10,Fthe post.
OL,12,FScott Chilton, who retired from the
OL,13,Fforce last year, is facing a police
OL,14,Fstandards tribunal over alleged
OL,15,Frelationships with two female officers.
OL,17,FHe "actively sought" to prevent an
OL,18,Finvestigation into a previous alleged
OL,19,Faffair, which he denies, the tribunal
OL,20,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
